{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.koito.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她抱着一叠文件站在门口",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.koito.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.koito.second",
    "idolId": "koito",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——啊，小糸，能稍微过来一下吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "ぴゃ……！？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………什、什么事……！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "抱歉，吓到你了。能稍微过来一下吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不用那么警惕也没关系。我不是要生气，也不是要骂你。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………好、好的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个，这个……加入 283 制作的时候，你从父母那里拿到文件了吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………！那、那个有什么问题吗！？是不是缺了什么……！？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，这个本身没有缺漏。只是要正式开始活动的话……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我想直接见一面打个招呼，或者说做说明和确认。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你说父母都很忙，但也不能就这样推进小糸的活动。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……………………",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "果然，很忙吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………是的。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……那让我打一次电话……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "诶……！啊、那个……！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "确认！……我来确认……我自己来……！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，这样吗？我这边会调整时间，你去问问父母方便的日子。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……我、我知道了…………",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……………………",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……说起来，听说小糸成绩很好。学习和课程兼顾没问题吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………是的……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……课程上了之后感觉怎么样？有什么困扰的事吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………没有……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，对了，指导老师夸你了。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "说果然幼驯染就是不一样，大家很有默契。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………！诶……",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "那、那是真的吗……！",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，说类型完全不同，但有一体感。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我也这么想。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "诶……诶嘿嘿。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "而且小糸又认真又努力。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "哇…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "听说你这样的地方，也给了其他成员好的影响。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "诶、诶嘿嘿……！就是这样！",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "大家，没有我可是不行的哦——！",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，是啊。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "就依靠你了。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "一起加油吧。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "和听说的完全一样。",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "作为制作人也是。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "好……！大、大家的事就交给我吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊哈哈，是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我好像明白小糸给了大家好的影响这句话了。",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "看着小糸，就会想努力啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "诶诶……那是什么意思……！？",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "等一下，制作人——！"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "为了大家，当然也为了小糸。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不明白的事、不安的事，什么都可以问我。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………！那个……我、我…………",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "我，才没有那种东西哦——！",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，这样啊。没有就好。不过要是有什么，随时告诉我。",
        "nextNodeId": "125"
      },
      "125": {
        "id": "125",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真的，随时。"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "听说小糸一扯到幼驯染，表情就特别好。",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……诶诶……！？",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那样的、小糸的样子，要是能让更多人知道就好了。"
      }
    }
  },
